===== Notes =====
See [[#OpenWrt Installation]] for SSH access, backup/check/install files, scp transfer, and OpenWrt download information. For the SAC2V1A variant, [[https://github.com/Lanchon/openwrt-tr4400-v2/issues/3|some changes are needed]], summarized below.

==== SAC2V1A install ====
Follow the RAC2V1A steps above to ssh/scp the mtd/ubi backup and install scripts.

'ssh-rsa' was deprecated long ago so needs a '-o' option to run. Create an alias 'ssho' for it:
